cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite the repository. The antifouling field trial that motivated it is Hao et al. (2022), DOI 10.1016/j.ibiod.2022.105400; this software is not part of that work."
title: settle-count
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "kfat77"
  website: "https://github.com/kfat77/settle-count"
abstract: >-
  Image quantification for marine biofouling settlement plates: coverage
  fraction and heatmap, clump-splitting individual counts based on distance
  transform and seeded watershed, and coverage-time curves. Distributed with a
  deterministic synthetic demo; it ships no experimental data.
keywords:
  - marine biofouling
  - settlement plate
  - image analysis
  - watershed
  - coverage
